// template: Coastline
// order: 1
// Melodic indie dance: an arp with delay opens the track, a tuned kick and a driving
// sidechained bass carry it, and a live-feel kit with ear-candy loops of different
// lengths (3, 4 and 8 bars) keeps it moving. Style reference only; every melody is original.
title "Coastline"
tempo 118
key eb major
kick:    kick       tight    x... x... x... x...                                   | pitch 52 | decay 0.35 | click 0.6 | sweep 3 | gain 1.25
sub:     sub        pure     c1 ~ ~ ~ . . . . / ab1 ~ ~ ~ . . . . / eb1 ~ ~ ~ . . . . / bb1 ~ ~ ~ . . . .   | duck 0.85 | gain 0.59
bass:    bass       rolling  . c2 c2 c3 . c2 c2 c2 . c2 c2 c3 . c2 eb2 c2 / . ab1 ab1 ab2 . ab1 ab1 ab1 . ab1 ab1 ab2 . ab1 c2 ab1 / . eb2 eb2 eb3 . eb2 eb2 eb2 . eb2 eb2 eb3 . eb2 g2 eb2 / . bb1 bb1 bb2 . bb1 bb1 bb1 . bb1 bb1 bb2 . bb1 d2 f2   | duck 0.85 | cutoff sine(8) 500..1800 | drive 0.25 | gain 1
rim:     rim        wood     .... x... .... x..x?0.4                               | reverb small | pan 0.15 | gain 0.8
snare:   snare      fat      .... x... .... x...                                   | reverb plate | gain 0.6
hat:     hat        tight    x x?0.6 x x?0.8 x x?0.6 x x?0.8 x x?0.6 x x?0.8 x x?0.6 x x?0.9   | open sine(8) 0.05..0.45 | swing 0.06 | pan 0.25 | gain 0.45
ride:    ride       wash     ..x. ..x. ..x. ..x.                                   | gain 0.42 | pan 0.2
shaker:  shaker     soft     x x?0.7 x x?0.7 x x?0.7 x x?0.7 x x?0.7 x x?0.7 x x?0.7 x x?0.7   | swing 0.08 | pan -0.3 | gain 0.18
shaker2: shaker     soft     . x . x . x . x . x . x . x . x                       | gain 0.12 | pan 0.35
perc:    perc       drop     .... .... ..x. .... / .... ..x. .... .x.. / .... .... .... x.x.   | delay 3/16 | reverb small | pan -0.35 | gain 0.55
verb:    noise      pink     .... .... .... .... / .... .... .... .... / .... .... .... .... / .... .... ..x~ ~~~~   | cutoff saw(4) 400..6000 | reverb wide | pan 0.3 | gain 0.35
fill:    clap       tight    .... / .... / .... / .... / .... / .... / .... / .... .... ..x. x.xx   | reverb wide | pan -0.1 | gain 0.5
tom:     tom        high     .... .... .... .... / .... .... .... .... / .... .... .... .... / .... .... .... .... / .... .... .... .... / .... .... .... .... / .... .... .... .... / .... .... x.x. xx.x   | reverb wide | pan -0.25 | gain 0.55
arp:     pluck      steel    Cm9 ~ ~ ~ / Abmaj9 ~ ~ ~ / Ebmaj9 ~ ~ ~ / Bb ~ ~ ~   | arp up | arp-rate 1/16 | arp-octaves 2 | highpass 500 | delay 3/16 | reverb wide | duck 0.5 | gain 0.5
pad:     pad        warm     Cm9 ~ ~ ~ / Abmaj9 ~ ~ ~ / Ebmaj9 ~ ~ ~ / Bb ~ ~ ~   | voicing spread | detune 0.5 | attack 1.2 | release 3 | brightness sine(16) 0.35..0.75 | duck 0.6 | reverb sea | gain 0.34
chords:  supersaw   wide     . Cm . Cm . Cm . Cm / . Ab . Ab . Ab . Ab / . Eb . Eb . Eb . Eb / . Bb . Bb . Bb . Bb   | duck 0.9 | cutoff saw(8) 1200..7000 | release 0.3 | chorus 0.3 | reverb wide | gain 0.4
guitar:  pluck      nylon    g4 . . eb5 . . d5 . / c5 . . ab4 . . g4 . / bb4 . . g4 . . eb5 . / d5 . f5 . d5 . bb4 .   | delay 3/16 | reverb wide | pan -0.3 | gain 0.5
hook:    lead       juno     g4 . g4 bb4 . c5 . bb4 / ab4 ~ ~ . g4 . eb4 . / g4 . g4 bb4 . eb5 . d5 / c5 ~ ~ ~ bb4 ~ . .   | detune 0.35 | attack 0.06 | release 1.2 | cutoff sine(16) 1800..4500 | glide 0.05 | delay 1/4 | reverb sea | gain 0.25
voice:   vox        ooh      eb4 ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ c4 ~ / c4 ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ . . / bb3 ~ ~ ~ g3 ~ bb3 ~ / d4 ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ . .   | legato | glide 0.06 | vowel sine(8) 0.3..0.8 | attack 0.08 | delay 1/4 | reverb hall | gain 0.41
chop:    vox        talk     . . eb5 . . c5 . . / . . ab4 . . . . . / . . g4 . . bb4 . . / . . f4 . . d4 . .   | vowel sine(4) 0.1..0.9 | delay 3/16 | reverb plate | pan 0.3 | gain 0.45
choir:   choir      aah      Cm ~ ~ ~ / Ab ~ ~ ~ / Eb ~ ~ ~ / Bb ~ ~ ~             | reverb plate | gain 0.36
piano:   piano      felt     Cm9 ~ ~ ~ / Abmaj9 ~ ~ ~ / Ebmaj9 ~ ~ ~ / Bb ~ ~ ~   | voicing open | reverb wide | gain 0.5
rise:    noise      white    x~~~ ~~~~ ~~~~ ~~~~                                   | cutoff saw(8) 300..9000 | gain saw(8) 0.15..0.5
riser:   riser      both     x... / .... / .... / .... / .... / .... / .... / ....   | length 15.5 | gain 0.5
down:    downlifter noise    x~~~ ~~~~ ~~~~ ~~~~ / .... / .... / .... / .... / .... / .... / ....   | reverb wide | gain 0.6
crash:   crash      wide     x... / .... / .... / .... / .... / .... / .... / ....   | reverb wide | gain 0.45
impact:  impact     hit      x... / .... / .... / .... / .... / .... / .... / ....   | reverb sea | gain 0.75
section intro   arp hat shaker perc verb
section groove  kick sub bass rim hat ride shaker shaker2 perc verb fill arp pad guitar | loop
section verse   kick sub bass rim hat shaker shaker2 perc verb fill tom arp pad voice chop
section build   kick rim hat shaker shaker2 perc fill tom arp pad chords rise
section drop    kick sub bass snare rim hat ride shaker shaker2 perc verb fill tom arp pad chords hook chop crash impact
section break   pad piano choir voice guitar down
section lift    hat arp choir chop riser
section drop2   kick sub bass snare rim hat ride shaker shaker2 perc verb fill tom arp pad chords guitar hook voice choir crash impact
section outro   kick hat shaker perc verb arp
song intro 8, groove 16, verse 16, build 8, drop 32, break 16, lift 8, drop2 32, groove 16, outro 16
